Here are the Terraform changes for deploying pgbouncer as a sidecar:

```hcl
resource "aws_ecs_task_definition" "app" {
  family = "app"
  container_definitions = jsonencode([
    {
      name  = "pgbouncer"
      image = "pgbouncer:latest"
      memory = 128
      portMappings = [
        {
          containerPort = 6432
          protocol      = "tcp"
        }
      ]
      healthCheck {
        command     = ["CMD", "pgbouncer", "-u", "pgbouncer", "/etc/pgbouncer/pgbouncer.ini"]
        interval    = 30
        timeout     = 5
        retries     = 3
        startPeriod = 10
      }
    }
  ])
}
```

Pgbouncer runs as a sidecar container in each service's task definition, with health checks on port 6432.
